<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 75 FOR THREE AT LUNCH VS NZ.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 75 FOR THREE AT LUNCH VS NZ.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, New Zealand 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka, chasing New Zealand's first innings total of 222, were 75 for three wickets on the second day of the second test on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand 222 (B. Pocock 85, M. Muralitharan 3-43, N. Zoysa 3-47)</p>
<p>Sri Lanka 75 for three (R Mahanama not out 41).</p>
